WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:15.215
Cat raced back to the Throne Room.

2
00:00:15.216 --> 00:00:20.358
"Tom!" she cried.

3
00:00:20.359 --> 00:00:23.834
"Daimon locked the king in the Grim Dungeon.

4
00:00:23.835 --> 00:00:26.578
He wants to take over the castle!"

5
00:00:26.579 --> 00:00:29.851
Tom gasped.

6
00:00:29.852 --> 00:00:32.500
"We must save the king!"

7
00:00:32.501 --> 00:00:35.217
Dirk could not hear Cat.

8
00:00:35.218 --> 00:00:37.858
He scowled at Tom.

9
00:00:37.859 --> 00:00:43.669
"What are you talking about?"

10
00:00:43.670 --> 00:00:47.546
Tom told Dirk about Daimon.

11
00:00:47.547 --> 00:00:51.152
"Don't make up stories!" Dirk snapped.

12
00:00:51.153 --> 00:00:53.576
He waved an arm at the tub.

13
00:00:53.577 --> 00:01:01.450
"Daimon is a good wizard—unlike you!"

14
00:01:01.451 --> 00:01:05.336
Cat growled softly.

15
00:01:05.337 --> 00:01:09.058
"Tom has a good heart," she hissed.

16
00:01:09.059 --> 00:01:12.019
But only Tom could hear her.

17
00:01:12.020 --> 00:01:16.400
Ann hurried in.

18
00:01:16.401 --> 00:01:19.823
"What's going on, Father?" she asked.

19
00:01:19.824 --> 00:01:23.670
"Tom is making up stories," Dirk said.

20
00:01:23.671 --> 00:01:27.252
"He says Daimon is taking over the castle."

21
00:01:27.253 --> 00:01:31.413
Ann gasped. "Oh no!"

22
00:01:31.414 --> 00:01:34.302
Dirk shook his head.

23
00:01:34.303 --> 00:01:36.070
"It's a lie.

24
00:01:36.071 --> 00:01:39.100
I'm going to the dungeon to see for myself."

25
00:01:39.101 --> 00:01:43.574
Dirk stomped off.

26
00:01:43.575 --> 00:01:46.793
Cat ran after him.

27
00:01:46.794 --> 00:01:50.159
Ann looked at Tom.

28
00:01:50.160 --> 00:01:52.193
Tom crossed his heart.

29
00:01:52.194 --> 00:01:54.747
"It's true, Ann."

30
00:01:54.748 --> 00:01:57.738
"I believe you, Tom," Ann said.

31
00:01:57.739 --> 00:02:02.712
"We can fight Daimon!"

32
00:02:02.713 --> 00:02:05.030
Ann explained her plan.

33
00:02:05.031 --> 00:02:06.864
"I will get the servants.

34
00:02:06.865 --> 00:02:09.113
You go get the guards.

35
00:02:09.114 --> 00:02:11.783
We can all stop that wizard!"

36
00:02:11.784 --> 00:02:14.992
"That's a good plan," Tom said.

37
00:02:14.993 --> 00:02:25.687
"We'll all gather here in a few minutes!"

